{"title":"Thak Veteran","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 68 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran?lv=66\">Lv 66 <span>141</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran?lv=67\">Lv 67 <span>20</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran?lv=68\">Lv 68</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>66</b></td><td>497</td><td>40.8</td><td>3,300</td><td class=\"muted\">1,491 · 57.1 · 9,900</td><td>141</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran?lv=67\" title=\"Pick level 67\"><td><b>67</b></td><td>504</td><td>41.4</td><td>3,350</td><td class=\"muted\">1,512 · 58 · 10,050</td><td>20</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran?lv=68\" title=\"Pick level 68\"><td><b>68</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>511</td><td>41.9</td><td>3,400</td><td class=\"muted\">1,533 · 58.7 · 10,200</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 15 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 20 recorded drops, 1,912 total, 51–132 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×51–132</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"trout-pie\" title=\"Trout Pie - in 7 of 15 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 7 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/cc91c9ea50a30869c73e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Trout Pie</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 2 of 15 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-longsword\" title=\"Gold Longsword - in 2 of 15 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/15780e2de7924ba9a7c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+9 more\">+9 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"tome-tailoring-emberweave\" title=\"Tome Tailoring Emberweave - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8fee9eb0ad07484d4dd3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tome Tailoring Emberweave</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"onion-seeds\" title=\"Onion Seeds - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/38221d7cbba166985903.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Onion Seeds</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-arms\" title=\"Lizper Arms - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f89c86145287e87430c2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-ruby\" title=\"Gem Ruby - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c3be065d1945333c2808.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Ruby</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-head\" title=\"Gravewrap Head - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\